  M('Teaching skills','Apply',16,'Clear and kind.','Plain words|Check understanding|Wait for answers','Ask two to explain back.','Teach one session.','Observed.','How check understanding?','Ask learners to explain back.'),
  M('Assessment','Create',16,'Fair and clear.','Task, condition, standard|Rubric|Give feedback in 48 hours','Pass at 70%.','Build assessment.','Rubric.','Why use a rubric?','Marks are fair and clear.'),
  M('Teach the programme','Apply',30,'Four sessions.','Attendance and notes|Adjust|Learner voice','Added extra example.','Teach all four.','Notes.','Why adjust?','To fit learners.'),
